              {
                "title": "",
                "description": "<p class=\"LexicalEditor_paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"LexicalEditor_textBold\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Millions of children. Five critical challenges. One opportunity to build what comes next.&nbsp;</strong></b></p><p class=\"LexicalEditor_paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">India has one of the world\u2019s largest school systems, </span><b><strong class=\"LexicalEditor_textBold\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">but millions of children still struggle to build foundational reading and maths skills.</strong></b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> In rural India, ASER 2024 finds that only around 7 in 10 Grade 3 children can\u2019t read a Grade 2-level text, while roughly 2 in 3 cannot do basic subtraction. Teachers and education systems also face everyday constraints, from multi-grade classrooms to limited time and data utilization to support every learner.</span></p><p class=\"LexicalEditor_paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"LexicalEditor_textBold\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">AI is transforming what technology can do </strong></b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">but its potential to solve India\u2019s toughest education challenges remains largely untapped. Now is the time to put that power to work on </span><b><strong class=\"LexicalEditor_textBold\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">five critical foundational learning challenges, identified and prioritised by leading organisations </strong></b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">focussing on education in India. Using real problems, real resources and frontier AI, this hackathon challenges innovators to turn bold ideas into working solutions.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"LexicalEditor_paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"LexicalEditor_textBold\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The challenge is yours to solve.</strong></b><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Over a span of 10 weeks, turn an ambitious idea into a working prototype that could help strengthen foundational learning for children from low-income communities, and discover what AI can make possible in the Indian classroom.</span></p><p class=\"LexicalEditor_paragraph\"><br></p>",
